WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.077 --> 00:00:05.358
Miss Brook: Welcome to the last day of camp!

2
00:00:05.359 --> 00:00:08.451
Sarah: I'm sad camp is over.

3
00:00:08.452 --> 00:00:11.835
Sarah: But I'm happy our pets are here.

4
00:00:11.836 --> 00:00:16.709
Snooks: [i@Ar-ooo!@i]

5
00:00:16.710 --> 00:00:19.557
Theo: Where's your pet, Kyle?

6
00:00:19.558 --> 00:00:25.600
Kyle: My mom is bringing my dog Banjo later.

7
00:00:25.601 --> 00:00:28.189
Miss Brook: Mack went to town.

8
00:00:28.190 --> 00:00:32.546
Miss Brook: But he'll be back for our party.

9
00:00:32.547 --> 00:00:37.160
Riley: What are we going to do today, Miss Brook?

10
00:00:37.161 --> 00:00:40.823
Miss Brook: We're going to get ready for the party.

11
00:00:40.824 --> 00:00:43.724
Ben: I wish we could do something for Mack.

12
00:00:43.725 --> 00:00:47.439
Ben: He let us use his farm for camp.

13
00:00:47.440 --> 00:00:51.028
Skyler: Hey! I know what we can do.

14
00:00:51.029 --> 00:00:54.890
Skyler: We can do some of Mack's chores today.

15
00:00:54.891 --> 00:00:59.205
Ben: Great idea! That will surprise him!

16
00:00:59.206 --> 00:01:02.964
Miss Brook: That might be hard with your pets.

17
00:01:02.965 --> 00:01:07.914
Theo: Nope, we're the Pet Lovers Club!

18
00:01:07.915 --> 00:01:13.933
Miss Brook: Hmm . . . okay. Why don't you collect eggs first?

19
00:01:13.934 --> 00:01:19.118
Miss Brook: I need some to make a cake for the party.

20
00:01:19.119 --> 00:01:22.335
Riley: We'll do it.

21
00:01:22.336 --> 00:01:25.744
Ben: Theo, let's groom Willy.

22
00:01:25.745 --> 00:01:29.134
Miss Brook: Be sure to watch your pets.

23
00:01:29.135 --> 00:01:35.971
Theo: Our pets have very good manners.

24
00:01:35.972 --> 00:01:39.378
Ben: Hi, Willy! We're going to groom you today.

25
00:01:39.379 --> 00:01:45.490
Ben: This is my turtle, Speedy.

26
00:01:45.491 --> 00:01:50.828
Theo: This is Frankie. He stays in my pocket.

27
00:01:50.829 --> 00:01:54.875
Theo: I don't want him to hop away.

28
00:01:54.876 --> 00:01:58.940
Skyler: Hi, chickens! Meet Chatter.

29
00:01:58.941 --> 00:02:02.283
Chickens: [i@Buk! Buk!@i]

30
00:02:02.284 --> 00:02:05.392
Snooks: [i@Ar-ooo!@i]

31
00:02:05.393 --> 00:02:11.913
Riley: Snooks is scared. He won't go near those chickens.

32
00:02:11.914 --> 00:02:17.711
Sarah: Pepper doesn't like them either. Oops!

33
00:02:17.712 --> 00:02:20.635
Sarah: She's running to the feed shed.

34
00:02:20.636 --> 00:02:23.928
Skyler: She'll probably meet Fang.

35
00:02:23.929 --> 00:02:30.949
Sarah: Good! They'll be best friends!

36
00:02:30.950 --> 00:02:34.169
Fang: [i@Hiss!@i]

37
00:02:34.170 --> 00:02:37.326
Pepper: [i@Grrowwl!@i]

